               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_149011d7">25 x 34.5</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_ca56720c">Bound in brown cardboard cover with library label. Written in ink. Paper: 16 staves. Paginated 3-26 which signifies that a bifolio with title page and pp. 27-28 are missing, as the overture ends abruptly. Heading added later in pencil in Gade's hand: "Ouverture 1836 - ".</physMedium>
